Folia full web application packaged for nTv.

Upstream application: https://github.com/chthollyphile/folia-major
Android-oriented upstream: https://github.com/chthollyphile/folia-sonnet
Reference deployment: https://music.aikun-bili.top/
License: GNU Affero General Public License version 3; see LICENSE.
Copyright: Folia contributors and the respective bundled dependency authors.

The original deployed frontend module graph is recorded, with SHA-256 hashes,
in assets/upstream-manifest.json. The deployed source revision is not published
by that deployment; this package does not claim a verified matching Git commit.
Java loopback serving, HTTP transport bridge and Android file selection are nTv
adaptations supplied in this directory and app/src/main/java/xiao/bu/tv.
No remote platform accounts, cookies, user data, API keys or music files are
included. Online provider services remain independently hosted upstream.

The adapter source is distributed under AGPL-3.0 together with this package.
